message: "If you use this software or its numerical data, please cite the archived release."
title: "Kerr Boson-Cloud Tidal Transitions: Code and Numerical Data"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Yi-kun"
    affiliation: "Xinjiang Astronomical Observatory, Chinese Academy of Sciences"
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: 2026-11-03
repository-code: "https://github.com/l46430640-del/kerr-boson-tidal-transitions"
url: "https://github.com/l46430640-del/kerr-boson-tidal-transitions"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Python implementations and validated numerical data for relativistic tidal
  transitions between scalar quasibound states of saturated Kerr boson clouds.
  Includes physical scalar currents, tidal torque and secular absorption
  response in coupled weak-cloud examples.
keywords:
  - Kerr black holes
  - boson clouds
  - tidal transitions
  - quasibound states
  - black-hole superradiance
